{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"total\" expr=\"0\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <assign location=\"total\" expr=\"1\">2</assign>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-body.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-body.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":9,"byteOffset":211,"endColumn":40,"endLine":5,"startColumn":31,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `expr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-body.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":42,"endLine":5,"startColumn":41,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<assign>` declares more than one value source: `expr` and the child content\n\n**Note:** `<assign>` takes the value it stores from exactly one of `expr` or inline child content; with both the value is ambiguous\n\n**Help:** keep one value source: remove `expr`, or remove the child content\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.4 <assign>","text":"`<assign>` declares more than one value source: `expr` and the child content"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":222,"start":221},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"`expr` is declared here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml053-assign-expr-and-body.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":40,"endLine":5,"startColumn":32,"startLine":5}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML053"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<data>` takes its value from exactly one of `src`, `expr`, or child content (SCXML 1.0 §5.3), `<content>` is either computed by `expr` or given as child content (§5.6), and `<assign>` takes its value from `expr` or child content (§5.4); with several sources the value is ambiguous"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: keep one value source and remove the others.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.3 <data>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML053` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#data","id":"SCXML053","name":"SCXML053","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<data>`, `<content>`, or `<assign>` has more than one value source"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}